        "steps": [
          "Substitute exact values: $\\sin 45^\\circ = \\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}$, $\\cos 30^\\circ = \\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{2}$, $\\cos 45^\\circ = \\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}$, $\\sin 30^\\circ = \\frac{1}{2}$",
          "Multiply terms: $\\left(\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}\\right)\\left(\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{2}\\right) + \\left(\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}\\right)\\left(\\frac{1}{2}\\right) = \\frac{\\sqrt{6}}{4} + \\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{4}$",
          "Combine over common denominator: $\\frac{\\sqrt{6} + \\sqrt{2}}{4}$"
