        "finalAnswer": "$\\frac{\\sqrt{6} + \\sqrt{2}}{4}$",
        "commonTrap": "Writing $\\sin(45^\\circ + 30^\\circ) = \\sin 45^\\circ + \\sin 30^\\circ$, which is completely false."
