          "Substitute into formula: $\\sin(2A) = 2\\left(\\frac{3}{5}\\right)\\left(\\frac{4}{5}\\right)$",
          "Compute product: $\\frac{2 \\times 3 \\times 4}{25} = \\frac{24}{25}$"
        ],
        "finalAnswer": "$\\frac{24}{25}$",
        "commonTrap": "Computing $2\\sin A = 2(3/5) = \\frac{6}{5}$, which is not $\\sin(2A)$."
      }
    },
